82:`fable_queue.md` ON EVERY REGENERATION.  Corrected 2026-08-29. ***  It said: *"the older
83:08-17/08-18 panels (`exitsweep`, `ovsync`, `armbdt`, `b118L`, `b120r`, `dfreq`,
84:`reprowitness`) were NOT re-fired and still carry genuine codex holds."*
