87:dated on or after that day on each row (ovsync carries three).  Six of the seven had their
88:stale markers defanged on 2026-08-29.  So this told the operator to re-fire seats that had
89:already answered, which is worse than a stale comment: a stale comment misleads a reader,
90:an action-instruction misdirects work.
